      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, sorry, what do you mean by \"golden goblin\"? I'm just looking for the biological mechanism here. Could you stick to the actual physiological process of how the surplus affects nitrogen retention? I need to explain this to a client who wants the hard science, not metaphors.",
